# Her Memories (WotG 41), which has no handler: the Crystal War quest Her Memories: Of Malign Maladies carries it. With
# Large Memory Fragments 1, 3 and 4 (GMs), Amaura in Southern San d'Oria plays that quest's 955, finished: begun; Prog 3
# and the Fey Stone (GMs). In Southern San d'Oria [S] Raustigne plays the quest's 169; its finish completes the quest
# (Large Memory Fragment 2), and xi.wotg.helpers.checkMemoryFragments, with four fragments, shows REPORT_TO_CAIT_SITH
# (027 messageName 6997), completes Her Memories and adds Forget Me Not.
lists SouthernSanDoria/Amaura/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/955 SouthernSanDoriaS/Raustigne/onTrigger SouthernSanDoriaS/onEventFinish/169
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=-82.867,-6.949,91.148 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg HerMemories current
keyitem LargeMemoryFragment1
keyitem LargeMemoryFragment3
keyitem LargeMemoryFragment4
login
trigger Amaura                             # 955
finish                                     # Of Malign Maladies begun
charvar Quest[7][72]Prog 3                 # a GM
keyitem FeyStone                           # a GM
warp 5.479,-1.999,44.456 SouthernSanDoriaS
trigger Raustigne                          # 169
finish                                     # the quest completed, the fourth fragment: Her Memories completed
